You can join the topics you are interested in and set how many notifications you get about each topic. If you want to find a file just search. It has to-do lists, reminders and video meetings.

You'll need a Meadowbrook account to access these spaces. To have one of these you'll already need to be part of the groups of trustees or volunteers. Contact [it@meadowbrookdartington.org](mailto:it@meadowbrookdartington.org) to get one.

Once you have an account, select a topic to get started. Topics include: Governance, Legal, Finance, Volunteers, Facilities, Contact, General, IT/Website/Branding, Energy, and Pool.

Meadowchat uses Google Chat. We recommend downloading the chat app on your phone and signing in.
